WEBVTT

00:05:27.031 --> 00:05:30.117
that I got on the internet afterwards.

00:05:30.159 --> 00:05:33.412
So this song, maybe you've heard it,
maybe you haven't.

00:05:33.454 --> 00:05:35.706
It is the true story

00:05:35.748 --> 00:05:39.210
about the first American woman
who they ever sent to space,

00:05:39.251 --> 00:05:41.462
whose name was Sally Ride.

00:05:42.254 --> 00:05:46.008
(Singing) Remember when NASA
sent a woman to space

00:05:46.050 --> 00:05:47.885
for only six days

00:05:47.927 --> 00:05:53.474
and they gave her one hundred tampons?

00:05:53.516 --> 00:05:57.269
One hundred tampons.

00:05:57.895 --> 00:06:02.983
(Laughter)